<view class="page"><view class="row"><view class="heading">我的售卖</view><text class="tag" bindtap="orders">查看售卖订单 ›</text></view><view class="sub">修改图文后重新审核，改价不影响已创建订单。</view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card sale"><view class="item"><image src="{{item.image}}" class="cover" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="item-content"><view class="title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="price">¥{{item.yuan}}</view><view class="tag">{{item.label}}</view></view></view><view wx:if="item.reviewReason" class="note">审核说明：{{item.reviewReason}}</view><view class="btn-row"><button class="secondary" wx:if="item.status!=='SOLD'" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="price">改价</button><button class="secondary" wx:if="item.status!=='SOLD'&&item.status!=='RESERVED'" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="edit">修改图文</button><button class="secondary" wx:if="item.status==='ACTIVE'||item.status==='PENDING'" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="offline">下架</button></view></view><view wx:if="!items.length" class="empty">还没有发布教材<text>
</text>在「发布」页上传你的闲置教材</view></view>
